[x] panel  - GlassPanel1   -> controls panel: IngestXRayPage.cs#_controlsPanel — a TsGlassPanel hosting the
             XRayControls vehicle/window/bucket picker bound to IngestXRayPageViewModel.ControlsModel (web
             <GlassPanel className="p-6"><XRayControls vehicles={vehicles.data ?? []} vehicleId={vehicleId}
             windowSel/bucketSel onVehicleChange/onWindowChange/onBucketChange/></GlassPanel>); change events wired
             IngestXRayPage.cs#OnVehicleChanged/OnWindowChanged/OnBucketChanged → ViewModel.SelectVehicleAsync/
             SelectWindowAsync/SelectBucketAsync; tests LoadAsync_VehiclesSuccess_ResolvesTheControls +
             SelectWindow_ReloadsXRay_WithTheNewWindow + SelectBucket_ReloadsXRay_WithTheNewBucket
[x] panel  - GlassPanel2   -> no-vehicle panel: IngestXRayPage.cs#_noVehiclePanel — a TsGlassPanel hosting a
             TsEmptyState (Title=ViewModel.NoVehicleTitle, Message=ViewModel.NoVehicleMessage), shown when
             ViewModel.ShowNoVehicle (web vehicleId === null → <GlassPanel><EmptyState title={t('admin.xray.
             noVehicle.title')} message={t('admin.xray.noVehicle.message')}/></GlassPanel>); test
             SelectVehicle_Null_ShowsNoVehiclePanel_AndDropsData + InitialState_IsVehiclesLoading_AndNoVehicleSelected
[x] panel  - GlassPanel3   -> bucket-chart panel: IngestXRayPage.cs#_chart — the XRayBucketChart surface (which
             self-wraps in its own TsGlassPanel Mica region) bound to IngestXRayPageViewModel.BucketChartModel
             (web <GlassPanel className="p-6"><XRayBucketChart buckets={xray.data?.buckets ?? []}
             loading={xray.isLoading}/></GlassPanel>); test SelectVehicle_XRaySuccess_ReachesReadyState_AndProjects
             ChildModels (BucketChartModel.Buckets) + SelectVehicle_XRayZeroSamples_ReachesEmptyState
[x] panel  - GlassPanel4   -> field-statistics panel: IngestXRayPage.cs#BuildFieldsPanel() — a TsGlassPanel hosting
             the Activity FontIcon + _fieldsTitle PanelTitle (ViewModel.PanelFieldsTitle) + the XRayFieldsTable
             surface bound to IngestXRayPageViewModel.FieldsTableModel (web <GlassPanel className="p-6"><Activity/>
             <PanelTitle>Field statistics</PanelTitle><XRayFieldsTable rows={xray.data?.fields ?? []}
             loading={xray.isLoading}/></GlassPanel>); test SelectVehicle_XRaySuccess_ReachesReadyState_AndProjects
             ChildModels (FieldsTableModel.Rows)

# Data states (3) — loading / empty / success, each a visible region (never blank)
[x] state  - loading       -> IngestXRayPageState.Loading (X-Ray query in flight with no data; vehicles fetch in
             flight = XRayVehiclesStatus.Loading): IngestXRayPage.cs#Render maps it to _freshness.IsFetching
             (TsDataFreshness "Updating…"), the XRayHeader em-dash tiles (HeaderDisplay.SamplesValue = EmDash via
             ContentSummary==null) and the child surfaces' own loading bodies (BucketChartModel.Loading /
             FieldsTableModel.Loading); tests SelectVehicle_XRayLoading_ShowsLoadingState_WithEmDashTiles +
             InitialState_IsVehiclesLoading_AndNoVehicleSelected
[x] state  - empty         -> IngestXRayPageState.Empty (X-Ray resolved with zero samples; the no-vehicle gate;
             the empty fleet): IngestXRayPage.cs#Render shows the XRayBucketChart/XRayFieldsTable EmptyState bodies
             (FieldsTableModel.Rows empty, BucketChartModel.Buckets empty) + the no-vehicle TsEmptyState
             (ShowNoVehicle) + the empty-fleet picker hint (ControlsModel.VehiclesStatus Resolved with 0 vehicles);
             tests SelectVehicle_XRayZeroSamples_ReachesEmptyState + LoadAsync_VehiclesEmpty_ResolvesWithNoVehicles +
             SelectVehicle_Null_ShowsNoVehiclePanel_AndDropsData
[x] state  - success       -> IngestXRayPageState.Ready (X-Ray resolved with data; fleet resolved): IngestXRayPage.cs#
             Render populates the XRayHeader tiles (HeaderDisplay.SamplesValue/FieldsValue/WindowValue) + the bucket
             chart + the field table from the bound BucketChartModel/FieldsTableModel, UpdatedAt drives the freshness
             chip ("Live"); the fleet success drives ControlsModel.VehiclesStatus=Resolved; tests
             SelectVehicle_XRaySuccess_ReachesReadyState_AndProjectsChildModels + LoadAsync_VehiclesSuccess_Resolves
             TheControls + RetryXRay_AfterFailure_RecoversToReady (error→success recovery)

